WEBVTT

00:20:28.658 --> 00:20:31.834
RB: In the context
of how we deliver work in our AVS,

00:20:31.858 --> 00:20:35.631
we've now looked
at this ASV and very shortly,

00:20:35.655 --> 00:20:37.615
we will need to do a T-Rex on that.

00:20:37.639 --> 00:20:40.986
I'd have never formulated that sentence
for you six months ago.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.160
(Laughs)

00:20:43.282 --> 00:20:45.706
AG: I joined the science
advisory board at BetterUp,

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.548
because coaches have been fundamental

00:20:47.572 --> 00:20:49.579
in helping me at every point in my career.

00:20:49.603 --> 00:20:52.218
I believe everyone
should have a coach in their corner.

00:20:52.242 --> 00:20:54.250
If you'd like to work
with greater clarity,

00:20:54.274 --> 00:20:55.490
purpose and passion,

00:20:55.514 --> 00:20:57.384
you can get a free trial with BetterUp

00:20:57.408 --> 00:20:59.360
at BetterUp.com/worklife.